    "text": "# Passenger Safety Briefing\n\nLife jackets are stored under every seat on the upper deck. Children under twelve must wear a life jacket on open decks.\n\n## Muster stations\n\nMuster station B is next to the cafe on the main deck.\n\nIn an emergency, follow the instructions of the crew at all times."
